# Unlocking a Myth: Warrior (jeuno 102): Lower Jeuno's Zalsuhm (no script; default 10085), the template UnlockingAMyth
# for xi.job.WAR (1). A level 75 WAR with the SturdyAxe (its Vigil weapon, Main slot) at 250 weapon skill points.
# Available: a trade: no trade handler; not wearing it: 10085; worn: 10086 (1), finished 0: nothing; 10086 again,
# finished 1: begun. Accepted: the cutscene 10087; a trade of the worn weapon: an equipped item can't be traded, so
# nothing (unworn, at 250 points, it would answer 10088: #trade). The other nineteen jobs' quests are silent (each check
# reads the main job).
lists LowerJeuno/Zalsuhm/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Zalsuhm/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10086
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-31.5,5.9,-117.5 job=WAR lvl=75
item SturdyAxe wsp=250
login
trade Zalsuhm SturdyAxe x1              # available: no trade handler; nothing
trigger Zalsuhm                         # not wearing the weapon: 10085
finish
equip SturdyAxe Main                    # the Main slot
trigger Zalsuhm                         # wearing it: 10086 (1)
finish option=0                         # neither 53 nor 1: nothing
trigger Zalsuhm                         # 10086 (1)
finish option=1                         # begun
trigger Zalsuhm                         # accepted: the cutscene 10087
finish
trade Zalsuhm SturdyAxe x1              # accepted, the axe worn: an equipped item can't be traded; nothing
